OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome early evening brightness at
OL,7,Ffirst, but turning unsettled with
OL,8,Fthickening cloud heralding periods of
OL,9,Frain that reach the far west late
OL,10,Fevening, before following to all
OL,11,Fovernight with heavier outbreaks in
OL,12,Fthe west and strengthening winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with rain
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times. Rain
OL,16,Fprogressively more patchy through
OL,17,Fmorning, leading to some brighter
OL,18,Fspells but still a few light showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
